    slug: 'higher-prices-washington-debt',
    href: '/share/higher-prices-washington-debt',
    label: 'Latest Video',
    title: 'Higher Prices, Endless Wars, and Washington Debt',
    teaser: "Jimmy discusses the rising cost of living, wars without a clear exit, and the debt burden Washington is placing on future generations.",
    meme: '/images/share/meme-higher-prices-washington-debt-fb.png',
    memeAlt: 'Higher Prices, Endless Wars, and Washington Debt — Jimmy Skovgard speaks plainly about three issues weighing on Wyoming families',
    memeBg: '#2b2b2b',
    tweetText: 'Higher prices, endless wars, and a $40 trillion debt spiral. Wyoming families pay the price. We need representatives from the people — not tied to big money. — Jimmy Skovgard for U.S. Senate 2026',
    emailSubject: 'Higher prices, endless wars, and Washington debt — a Wyoming message',
    emailBody: [
      "Hi,",
      "",
      "I wanted to share a short video message from Jimmy Skovgard about three issues",
      "weighing on Wyoming families right now.",
      "",
      "The economy may look strong on paper, but printed money and runaway spending show up",
      "at the grocery store, the gas pump, the utility bill, and the cost of a home or vehicle.",
      "",
      "America keeps entering conflicts without a clear path out — open-ended wars that cost",
      "lives, treasure, and the trust that holds a nation together.",
      "",
      "And the debt keeps climbing. We went from $36 trillion to nearly $40 trillion in less",
      "than two years. Elected officials who abdicate their responsibility hand the bill to",
      "our grandchildren.",
      "",
      "The answer starts with accountability: representatives from the people, not tied to",
      "big money, and willing to speak honestly about what is happening.",
      "",
      `Watch the video: ${BASE}/share/higher-prices-washington-debt/`,
      "",
      "Stay connected at skovgard2026.org/pulse",
      "",
      "Jimmy Skovgard — Preserving our legacy. Empowering our future.",
      "Paid for by Skovgard for Senate.",
