      "The Wyoming Candidate Hub is a simple place to find every candidate running for",
      "office in Wyoming — so voters can compare the field, ask better questions, and",
      "make their own decisions.",
      "",
      "This project is part of a larger effort to bring accountability, transparency,",
      "and public input back into the center of our election process.",
      "",
      `View the Candidate Hub: https://candidates.skovgard2026.org/`,
      "",
      "Every candidate. One place. Wyoming voters decide.",
      "",
      "Jimmy Skovgard — Preserving our legacy. Empowering our future.",
      "Paid for by Skovgard for Senate.",
    ].join("\n"),
  },
  {
    slug: 'fleecing-letters',
    href: '/share/fleecing-letters',
    label: 'Official Accountability',
    title: 'The Fleecing Letters',
