    emailBody: [
      "Hi,",
      "",
      "Two official letters arrived in Wyoming mailboxes on congressional letterhead —",
      "both marked 'PAID FOR BY OFFICIAL FUNDS AUTHORIZED BY THE HOUSE OF REPRESENTATIVES.'",
      "",
