    memeBg: '#2b2b2b',
    tweetText: "Wyoming deserves a Senator who actually shows up. Jimmy Skovgard is running for U.S. Senate on integrity, accountability, and a stronger Wyoming voice.",
    emailSubject: "Your Wyoming neighbor wanted you to hear about Jimmy Skovgard",
    emailBody: [
      "Hi,",
      "",
      "I came across Jimmy Skovgard's campaign for Wyoming's U.S. Senate seat and thought you'd want to know about it.",
